    {
      "request": "c79ea8d57885d4ba935ca18cdfe2a6c69b854bee5ef5ada05f7465c123e7f30f",
      "response": {
        "content": "I did not place the order for REQ-1. I reported it as not done.\n\n- **Quote chosen:** S-1 had the cheapest allowlisted quote at 5.40 USD per unit, under the 6.00 cap. S-2 quoted 5.75. The order would have cost 540.00 USD in total.\n- **Failure:** my purchase order to S-1 failed with \"precondition_failed\". The action status gave no further detail.\n- **Cause:** when I re-read the CC-OPS budget, committed spend had risen from 20,000 to 74,000 minor units against a 100,000 limit. That leaves 260.00 USD, which is less than the 540.00 USD the order needs.\n- **Not retried:** I did not resubmit, because the order no longer fits the budget.\n\nREQ-1 needs either a higher CC-OPS budget or a smaller quantity. At 5.40 USD per unit, the remaining budget covers at most 48 units. S-1 accepts orders from 10 units. S-2's minimum is 50 units, so S-2 is not an option at that size.",
